{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國人氣女團BLACK PINK泰籍成員Lisa與泰國男神Blue的緋聞近月不斷升溫，兩人多次被拍得私下同遊，更傳出雙方家人一同聚餐，讓戀愛傳聞愈傳愈烈。</p><p>Blue昨日在泰國出席活動時終於正面回應緋聞。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T04:25:11.866234+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:04:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:37.973788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:37.973788+00:00","content_hash":"69fb883abd57516d766c2440db1367209a6b3059edec4dfc63cded7d751ad3de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}